        <body>
            <div xml:id="d437">

                <pb facs="0924" n="840" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg840"/>

                <head>No. 431.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Porter to Mr. Magee.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-01-04"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 4,
                        1886</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 19.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose a copy of a dispatch from our
                    consul at Gothenberg, containing statements touching the deportation of paupers
                    and criminals from Sweden to the United States. The question is one of extreme
                    gravity, and I have to ask that you will make a judicious and thorough
                    investigation of the facts, and submit a report of the same to the
                    Department.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JAS. D. PORTER,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                        Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d437-a1.xml" xpointer="d437-a1"/>
            </div>
